Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:27:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix PDF rendering errors and improve letterhead layout -
 backend/main.py: Add _safe_text and _to_float helpers to prevent crashes on
 None/invalid data during PDF generation - backend/main.py: Refactor
 draw_pdf_kop_reportlab and SPJFPDF.draw_header to enforce proportional logo
 scaling (max height/width) and dynamic text centering between logos -
 backend/main.py: Implement auto-shrinking font logic for letterhead lines to
 ensure text fits within available space without overlapping logos -
 backend/main.py: Remove letterhead section from kwitansi PDF generation as
 requested, updating title placement accordingly - backend/main.py:
 Standardize date and currency formatting using safe conversion utilities to
 handle Indonesian number formats

